<title>USA: Paragon Trade Q3 shr rises to $0.87.</title>
<headline>Paragon Trade Q3 shr rises to $0.87.</headline>
<dateline>NORCROSS, Ga. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	profit	  $0.87   profit	 $0.22</p>
<p> Net	profit	 10,486   profit	 2,638</p>
<p> Net Sales		151,549		  131,444</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  12,116		   11,737</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	 $1.27     loss	 $0.60</p>
<p> Net	 profit	15,254     loss	 7,081</p>
<p> Net Sales		439,480		  385,288</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  12,028		   11,765</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding charges associated with Paragon's corporate relocation and start-up expenses related to its feminine care business, adjusted third quarter net earnings were $13.1 million, or $1.08 per share.</p>
<p>Full company name is Paragon Trade Brands Inc.</p>
